# Everything under /scripts is local tooling/logs EXCEPT the GHA
# runners + CI guard, which MUST be versioned (workflows depend on them):
#   scripts/blog-runner        → blog pipeline v2 (generate-blog-post.yml)
#   scripts/ai-jobs-runner     → whole-AI-system queue worker (process-ai-jobs.yml)
#   scripts/check-stale-refs.sh → anti-regression guard (guard-stale-refs.yml)
#   scripts/migration_audit.py → migrations ↔ types.ts audit (docs-parity-gate.yml)
#   scripts/docs_parity.py     → migration-registry gate (docs-parity-gate.yml, Phase 106)
#   scripts/docs_audit.py      → knowledge-system gate (docs-parity-gate.yml, Phase 107)
#   scripts/db-backup.mjs      → daily DB snapshot (db-backup.yml, 2026-09-05)
#   scripts/db-restore.mjs     → snapshot restore tool (db-backup.yml docs)
#   scripts/retro-pair-blog.mjs → Proposal-3 retro pairing applier (retro-pair-blog.yml, 2026-09-09)
#   scripts/retro-pair-blog.pairs.json → approved pairs + owner review list (retro-pair-blog.yml)
#   scripts/legacy-msa-patches/ → hand-written MSA conversions for the chain-unconvertible stubborn AR articles (legacy-ar-cleanup.yml PATCH mode, 2026-09-11)
#   scripts/vercel-cleanup/    → daily Vercel stale-deployment purge (vercel-cleanup.yml, Phase 145)
#   scripts/generate-og-cards.py → og:image family-card generator (Phase 188 — guarded by og-image-coverage.test.ts; the file was never committed because the /scripts/* blanket swallowed it, so the guard failed in CI from f954e85 until Phase 189 fixed the exception list)
#   scripts/cls-measure.mjs    → lab CLS measurement with throttling + per-shift attribution (Phase 216 P2-5 — the verification tool for the Arabic-fallback fix)
#   scripts/js-transfer-measure.mjs → critical-vs-post-load JS transfer measurement (Phase 216 P2-4 — the calibration evidence tool)
#   scripts/storage-inventory.mjs → daily storage bucket census (storage-inventory.yml, P0-3(b) hardening plan 2026-09-20 — hit the same /scripts/* blanket trap as generate-og-cards.py; exception added same frame)
