#   scripts/storage-backup.mjs → daily Supabase Storage FILE backup (storage-backup.yml, P0-3(c) owner order 2026-09-20 — same /scripts/* blanket trap; exception added same frame)
#   scripts/storage-restore.mjs → storage restore/drill tool (storage-restore-drill.yml + runbook §5, P0-3(c) 2026-09-20)
